# docs/design.md §11.3: Next's hashed static files never change, so browsers keep them for a year.
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public,max-age=31536000,immutable

# docs/design.md §11.3, §11.8: the item photos have unhashed names, so browsers keep them for a day.
/items/*
  Cache-Control: public,max-age=86400
